      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "e36d56de-e7bf-4657-b0fa-f455d4899e71",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Modernize the VProfile application using AWS managed services.\n\n- **Technologies:**\n  - Amazon RDS, Amazon ElastiCache, Amazon MQ, Elastic Beanstalk, CloudFront\n\n- **What This Project Proves:**\n  - I understand cloud modernization using AWS managed services.\n\n- **Portfolio Rank:**\n  - #11\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Build the re-architected cloud solution.\n  - **How:**\n    - Replace self-managed services with AWS managed services and understand the architectural improvements.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Projects & GitHub Evolution**\n  - **What:**\n    - Convert the project into a portfolio repository.\n  - **How:**\n    - Include before-and-after architecture diagrams, deployment documentation, screenshots, and implementation details.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Explain the modernization journey.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create architecture comparisons, document migration decisions, and record a walkthrough.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness & Job Conversion**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate cloud architecture knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Practice AWS architecture interview questions and prepare 20–30 interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
