      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Capability 13 — Python Automation\n\n- **Course Sections:** 20 — Python\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7220,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "9d779745-fa81-444b-9e50-5dfc7ec32593",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Capability Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Learn Python as an automation language for DevOps tasks and cloud operations.\n\n- **Why It Matters:**\n  - Python is widely used for infrastructure automation, cloud SDKs, scripting, API integration, and operational tooling.\n\n- **Supports Projects:**\n  - Project 2\n  - Project 4\n  - Project 5\n  - Project 6\n  - Project 7\n  - Project 8\n  - Project 9\n  - Project 10\n  - Project 11\n  - Project 15\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Learn Python for DevOps automation.\n  - **How:**\n    - Practice variables, functions, modules, exception handling, file operations, OS interaction, subprocess execution, and cloud automation with Python.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Knowledge Notes**\n  - **What:**\n    - Build a Python automation handbook.\n  - **How:**\n    - Document syntax, automation examples, cloud SDK usage, Fabric examples, and reusable scripts.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Explain Python automation.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create automation flow diagrams, explain Python use cases in DevOps, and document practical examples.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate Python automation knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Solve automation problems, explain Python scripts, and prepare 20–30 Python DevOps interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 15960,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "1552cc9e-880a-490b-8d26-91624d570a32",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Definition of Done\n\n- [ ] Able to automate tasks using Python\n- [ ] Cloud automation concepts understood\n- [ ] Notes completed\n- [ ] Interview ready\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 16340,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "bd856c12-6480-4243-856b-98e359446758",
      "type": "text",
