      "id": "f01ce613-eebc-4db0-97be-e79a9ac4477b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project 9 — Monitoring & Observability Platform\n\n- **Course Sections:** 23\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8360,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "987aba99-1022-49c8-ae23-12c61a9a1022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Build a complete monitoring and observability platform for infrastructure and applications.\n\n- **Technologies:**\n  - Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, PromQL\n\n- **What This Project Proves:**\n  - I can monitor production infrastructure, visualize metrics, collect logs, and configure alerting.\n\n- **Portfolio Rank:**\n  - #6\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Build the monitoring platform.\n  - **How:**\n    - Install Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, configure exporters, build dashboards, create PromQL queries, and integrate alert notifications.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Projects & GitHub Evolution**\n  - **What:**\n    - Turn the monitoring platform into a professional portfolio repository.\n  - **How:**\n    - Publish monitoring architecture diagrams, dashboard screenshots, Prometheus configuration, Grafana dashboards, alert rules, and documentation.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Explain observability.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create monitoring architecture diagrams, explain metrics, logs, alerting workflow, and record a dashboard walkthrough.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness & Job Conversion**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate monitoring knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Practice Prometheus, Grafana, and observability interview questions, explain monitoring architecture, troubleshoot monitoring issues, and prepare 20–30 interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 19000,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "4c2d115f-3803-4cbf-b4eb-c81254223d0d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Deliverables\n\n- [ ] GitHub Repository\n- [ ] Professional README\n- [ ] Monitoring Architecture Diagram\n- [ ] Grafana Dashboards\n- [ ] Prometheus Configuration\n- [ ] Alert Rules\n- [ ] Dashboard Screenshots\n- [ ] Demo Video\n- [ ] Deployment Guide\n- [ ] Lessons Learned\n- [ ] Future Improvements\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 19380,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "6a466c10-e34e-480f-b768-12d21e8fb070",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Definition of Done\n\n- [ ] Monitoring platform operational\n- [ ] Dashboards functioning correctly\n- [ ] Alerts configured\n- [ ] Repository complete\n- [ ] Documentation complete\n- [ ] Demo video recorded\n- [ ] Able to explain observability confidently\n- [ ] Interview ready\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
