    {
      "id": "d28b67e4-2f83-4119-b6a1-32f87942f067",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project 11 — GCP Cloud Infrastructure\n\n- **Course Sections:** 26\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9500,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "a50f53d4-2ade-4ce2-b60c-58d7c01c2fff",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Deploy the VProfile application on Google Cloud Platform.\n\n- **Technologies:**\n  - Google Cloud Platform (GCP), VPC, Cloud SQL, Memorystore, Managed Instance Groups, Load Balancer\n\n- **What This Project Proves:**\n  - I can design and deploy cloud infrastructure across multiple cloud providers.\n\n- **Portfolio Rank:**\n  - #12\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Build cloud infrastructure on GCP.\n  - **How:**\n    - Configure networking, virtual machines, managed services, instance groups, Cloud SQL, Memorystore, and load balancing while understanding GCP architecture.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Projects & GitHub Evolution**\n  - **What:**\n    - Turn the GCP deployment into a professional portfolio repository.\n  - **How:**\n    - Publish GCP architecture diagrams, deployment documentation, screenshots, infrastructure configuration, and supporting files.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Explain GCP architecture.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create architecture walkthroughs, compare AWS and GCP designs, and record a project demo.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness & Job Conversion**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate GCP knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Practice GCP interview questions, explain architectural decisions, troubleshoot cloud deployments, and prepare 20–30 interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 22040,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "07059b0f-fc58-441c-a28b-95c56bf274b8",
