      "id": "d1ab7d8b-3f2b-4c91-9bd9-0db201443311",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project 12 — Production Docker Platform\n\n- **Course Sections:** 27–28\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9880,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "54acac23-1ca5-4913-a8ee-3e53990d6c24",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Containerize the VProfile application and build production-ready Docker images.\n\n- **Technologies:**\n  - Docker, Docker Compose, Docker Hub\n\n- **What This Project Proves:**\n  - I can package applications into production-ready containers and manage multi-container environments.\n\n- **Portfolio Rank:**\n  - #5\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Build the Docker platform.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create Dockerfiles, optimize images, build multi-stage images, configure Docker Compose, publish images to Docker Hub, and validate the complete containerized application.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Projects & GitHub Evolution**\n  - **What:**\n    - Turn the Docker platform into a professional portfolio repository.\n  - **How:**\n    - Publish Dockerfiles, Docker Compose files, container architecture diagrams, screenshots, deployment guide, and documentation.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Explain containerization.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create container architecture diagrams, explain image-building strategy, compare VMs vs containers, and record a project walkthrough.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness & Job Conversion**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate Docker knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Practice Docker interview questions, explain container lifecycle, troubleshoot Docker issues, and prepare 20–30 interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 23180,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "ca38c41e-36b6-40bc-a743-3a1f7a914984",
