    {
      "id": "349802d8-82a0-4ae1-a7a0-a7463210bb03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project 14 — VProfile Deployment on Kubernetes\n\n- **Course Sections:** 30\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10640,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "0cfc1141-e0ae-4350-83fa-07ef349a0fb7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Deploy the complete VProfile application onto Kubernetes.\n\n- **Technologies:**\n  - Kubernetes, Helm, MySQL, RabbitMQ, Memcached, Nginx\n\n- **What This Project Proves:**\n  - I can deploy and operate a real-world multi-tier application on Kubernetes.\n\n- **Portfolio Rank:**\n  - #1 (Flagship Project)\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Deploy the VProfile application on Kubernetes.\n  - **How:**\n    - Configure persistent storage, Secrets, ConfigMaps, Services, Ingress, application manifests, and validate end-to-end application deployment.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Projects & GitHub Evolution**\n  - **What:**\n    - Turn the Kubernetes deployment into a flagship portfolio repository.\n  - **How:**\n    - Publish architecture diagrams, manifests, Helm charts, screenshots, deployment documentation, troubleshooting guide, and supporting files.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Showcase the flagship project.\n  - **How:**\n    - Write a LinkedIn article, create a detailed architecture walkthrough, explain deployment decisions, and record a professional demo video.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness & Job Conversion**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate complete Kubernetes deployment knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Explain the entire architecture without notes, troubleshoot production scenarios, answer Kubernetes deployment questions, and prepare 20–30 interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 25460,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "adba3b06-6fb9-45d7-adee-a0ba9dbeea6a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Deliverables\n\n- [ ] GitHub Repository\n- [ ] Professional README\n- [ ] End-to-End Architecture Diagram\n- [ ] Kubernetes Manifests\n- [ ] Helm Charts\n- [ ] Deployment Screenshots\n- [ ] Demo Video\n- [ ] Deployment Guide\n- [ ] Troubleshooting Guide\n- [ ] Lessons Learned\n- [ ] Future Improvements\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
