      "id": "4067a3fa-5f9e-46e5-9f1b-16cb851e2d1f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Definition of Done\n\n- [ ] Complete application deployed successfully\n- [ ] All services communicating correctly\n- [ ] Repository complete\n- [ ] Documentation complete\n- [ ] Demo video recorded\n- [ ] Able to explain the complete architecture confidently\n- [ ] Ready to showcase as flagship portfolio project\n\n",
      "x": 650,
