    {
      "id": "c7542c8e-059e-44f3-9549-024b51699783",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project 15 — GitOps Platform (Argo CD)\n\n- **Course Sections:** 31\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11020,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "9f5bcf8f-b227-4122-ba3b-fa0f880248cf",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Project Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Build a complete GitOps platform that continuously deploys Kubernetes applications using Argo CD.\n\n- **Technologies:**\n  - Argo CD, Kubernetes, Helm, GitHub Actions, Amazon ECR, Amazon EKS, SonarQube\n\n- **What This Project Proves:**\n  - I can design and operate a modern enterprise GitOps platform with automated CI/CD, Kubernetes, and continuous reconciliation.\n\n- **Portfolio Rank:**\n  - #1 (Capstone Project)\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Build the GitOps platform.\n  - **How:**\n    - Configure Git repositories, GitHub Actions pipelines, Amazon ECR, Amazon EKS, Helm charts, Argo CD applications, and continuous synchronization while understanding the complete GitOps workflow.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Projects & GitHub Evolution**\n  - **What:**\n    - Turn the GitOps platform into a capstone portfolio repository.\n  - **How:**\n    - Publish GitOps architecture diagrams, Helm charts, Kubernetes manifests, GitHub Actions workflows, Argo CD configuration, screenshots, documentation, and deployment guide.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Showcase the complete DevOps platform.\n  - **How:**\n    - Create an end-to-end DevOps architecture walkthrough, explain GitOps concepts, publish a LinkedIn article, and record a professional demonstration video.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness & Job Conversion**\n  - **What:**\n    - Validate complete DevOps platform knowledge.\n  - **How:**\n    - Explain the entire CI/CD + Kubernetes + GitOps workflow without notes, troubleshoot deployment scenarios, answer GitOps interview questions, and prepare 20–30 interview questions with answers.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 26600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "2b40ce56-77f8-4e97-bad6-9f28880679a2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Deliverables\n\n- [ ] GitHub Repository\n- [ ] Professional README\n- [ ] Complete DevOps Architecture Diagram\n- [ ] GitHub Actions Workflows\n- [ ] Kubernetes Manifests\n- [ ] Helm Charts\n- [ ] Argo CD Configuration\n- [ ] Deployment Screenshots\n- [ ] Demo Video\n- [ ] Deployment Guide\n- [ ] Troubleshooting Guide\n- [ ] Lessons Learned\n- [ ] Future Improvements\n\n- ---\n\n",
