    },
    {
      "id": "9a962d0a-a390-4e0f-84bc-3f13c5a785d3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Capability Definition\n\n- **Purpose:**\n  - Consolidate all knowledge gained throughout the course and prepare for DevOps job applications.\n\n- **Why It Matters:**\n  - Technical knowledge alone is not enough—this capability ensures you are ready to present your work professionally and convert it into job opportunities.\n\n- **Supports Projects:**\n  - Project 1–15\n\n- ---\n\n- [ ] **Track 1 — Core Technical Building**\n  - **What:**\n    - Review the complete DevOps learning journey.\n  - **How:**\n    - Revisit weak areas, validate every major capability, and ensure each project works successfully.\n\n- [ ] **Track 2 — Knowledge Notes**\n  - **What:**\n    - Organize the complete DevOps knowledge base.\n  - **How:**\n    - Consolidate notes, diagrams, commands, troubleshooting guides, and project documentation into a structured reference.\n\n- [ ] **Track 3 — Personal Branding & Communication**\n  - **What:**\n    - Prepare for professional visibility.\n  - **How:**\n    - Update LinkedIn, GitHub profile, resume, portfolio, and create a summary of completed projects.\n\n- [ ] **Track 4 — Interview Readiness**\n  - **What:**\n    - Prepare for job interviews.\n  - **How:**\n    - Review all interview questions, revisit weak topics, conduct mock interviews, and finalize technical confidence assessment.\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 27740,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "dbcc2db8-8ac4-4a2a-95b6-44a0bfc979c0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Definition of Done\n\n- [ ] All projects completed\n- [ ] Portfolio finalized\n- [ ] Resume updated\n- [ ] LinkedIn updated\n- [ ] GitHub profile polished\n- [ ] Interview ready\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 28120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "d1d7e513-a687-45bf-ba44-f1c01a1ef8e7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Final Portfolio Checklist\n\n- [ ] All 15 Projects completed\n- [ ] All Capability milestones completed\n- [ ] Every project uploaded to GitHub\n- [ ] Every repository has a professional README\n- [ ] Architecture diagrams created\n- [ ] Deployment guides completed\n- [ ] Demo videos recorded\n- [ ] Lessons learned documented\n- [ ] Future improvements documented\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11780,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "be5d21ab-95d9-4a3a-bea6-89b51e3451ed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# GitHub Profile Checklist\n\n- [ ] Professional GitHub profile picture\n- [ ] Professional bio\n- [ ] Pinned flagship repositories\n- [ ] Consistent repository naming\n- [ ] Well-written READMEs\n- [ ] Clean commit history\n- [ ] Organized repository structure\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12160,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "a7a201dd-f1a7-4a25-a600-6acf6a23eaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Resume Checklist\n\n- [ ] Resume updated with all major projects\n- [ ] Technologies listed correctly\n- [ ] Quantifiable project achievements included\n- [ ] GitHub profile added\n- [ ] LinkedIn profile added\n- [ ] Resume reviewed and polished\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12540,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "bf143818-767d-4413-8699-049c1d5e764b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# LinkedIn Checklist\n\n- [ ] Professional headline\n- [ ] Updated About section\n- [ ] Featured GitHub projects\n- [ ] Published project posts\n- [ ] Professional profile photo\n- [ ] Skills updated\n- [ ] Certifications added (if applicable)\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12920,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "ce257b10-3661-44a5-b685-6170da7bb30d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Interview Readiness Checklist\n\n- [ ] Linux\n- [ ] Git\n- [ ] Networking\n- [ ] Bash\n- [ ] Python\n- [ ] AWS\n- [ ] Docker\n- [ ] Kubernetes\n- [ ] Terraform\n- [ ] Ansible\n- [ ] Jenkins\n- [ ] GitHub Actions\n- [ ] GitLab CI\n- [ ] Monitoring\n- [ ] GitOps\n- [ ] VProfile Project\n- [ ] Kubernetes Deployment Project\n- [ ] GitOps Capstone Project\n\n- ---\n\n",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 13300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "3b1339a2-b0ca-4759-b82f-99d1018a96b9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# DevOps Job Readiness Checklist\n\n- [ ] Strong Linux fundamentals\n- [ ] Strong Networking fundamentals\n- [ ] Cloud fundamentals\n- [ ] Infrastructure as Code\n- [ ] Configuration Management\n- [ ] CI/CD\n- [ ] Containers\n- [ ] Kubernetes\n- [ ] Monitoring & Observability\n- [ ] GitOps\n- [ ] Multi-cloud exposure\n- [ ] Professional GitHub portfolio\n- [ ] Professional LinkedIn profile\n- [ ] Resume ready\n- [ ] Mock interviews completed\n- [ ] Confident explaining every project\n- [ ] Ready to apply for DevOps Engineer roles\n",
      "x": 0,
